    trida  "Ya jelas berhasil dong! Penjelasanku tadi kan tergolong detail banget!"

# game/week10.rpy:33
translate indonesian week10_romance_94283e8a:

    # p "Detailed doesn't mean understandable…"
    p  "Detail bukan berarti gampang dipahami ya..."

# game/week10.rpy:34
translate indonesian week10_romance_c6b47c81:

    # p "Well, I'm running late. Talk to you later, Trida."
    p  "Waduh, aku udah hampir telat nih. Nanti kita ngobrol lagi ya, Trida."

# game/week10.rpy:35
translate indonesian week10_romance_52d564b8:

    # trida "See ya, [player_name]…!"
    trida  "Sampai nanti, [player_name]...!"

# game/week10.rpy:38
translate indonesian week10_romance_1b3c0a5e:

    # n "Your figure retreated toward the school building, leaving Trida alone with their thoughts."
    n  "Langkah kakimu beranjak menjauh menuju gedung sekolah, meninggalkan Trida seorang diri bersama lamunannya."

# game/week10.rpy:39
translate indonesian week10_romance_df465d05:

    # n "Thoughts that immediately drifted to wanting to spend just a little more time with you… to feel your warmth in the quiet, mundane moments of the day, and to make you smile."
    n  "Pikiran yang seketika melayang pada keinginan untuk menghabiskan waktu lebih lama bersamamu... merasakan kehangatanmu di momen-momen sunyi sehari-hari, dan melihatmu tersenyum."

# game/week10.rpy:42
translate indonesian week10_romance_c7782b35:

    # trida "Oh, you…"
    trida  "Duh, kamu ini..."

# game/week10.rpy:43
translate indonesian week10_romance_a0991366:

    # n "Trida let out a shaky sigh, their heart racing with fluttering fondness as their ears warmed beneath messy brown hair."
    n  "Trida menghembuskan napas gemetar, jantungnya berdegup kencang diliputi getaran rasa suka seraya daun telinganya memanas di balik rambut cokelatnya yang acak-acakan."

# game/week10.rpy:44
translate indonesian week10_romance_17159c8d:

    # n "They stared down at the iced tea in their hands, watching condensation drip along the plastic cup as their fingers fidgeted with the straw."
    n  "Ia menatap nanar es teh di genggamannya, memperhatikan butir-butir embun dingin yang menetes di gelas plastik saat jemarinya memainkan sedotan."

# game/week10.rpy:47
translate indonesian week10_romance_265a9ba1:

    # trida "It's—agh—it's fine, I'm fine! Just… just tell them! Just tell them, and if… if they leave…"
    trida  "Nggak—ugh—nggak apa-apa, aku nggak apa-apa! Pokoknya... jujur aja ke dia! Tinggal omongin aja, dan kalau... kalau dia nolak..."

# game/week10.rpy:48
translate indonesian week10_romance_f361c19f:

    # trida "No—no, forget that! What do I even say?! Gosh…"
    trida  "Nggak, nggak! Jangan mikir aneh-aneh! Tapi harus mulai dari mana ngomongnya?! Ya ampun..."

# game/week10.rpy:50
translate indonesian week10_romance_964ef1f3:

    # n "Trida ended their endless murmuring with a quiet whine, their anxiety spiking as they realized how completely new this territory was."
    n  "Trida mengakhiri gumaman panjangnya dengan rengekan lirih, rasa cemasnya membuncah menyadari betapa asingnya situasi seperti ini baginya."

# game/week10.rpy:51
translate indonesian week10_romance_53ece3b4:

    # n "Checking their phone, they saw there were still a few hours before you would finish."
    n  "Melihat jam di ponselnya, masih ada beberapa jam tersisa sebelum kamu selesai presentasi."

# game/week10.rpy:52
translate indonesian week10_romance_40f4bf86:

    # n "They needed a plan. A plan from someone who had actually done this before."
    n  "Ia butuh rencana matang. Saran dari seseorang yang sudah berpengalaman menghadapi hal semacam ini."

# game/week10.rpy:58
translate indonesian week10_romance_5f793839:

    # n "With a sense of terrified determination, Trida sprinted through the hallway toward the second-floor classrooms."
    n  "Didorong tekad campur panik yang membara, Trida berlari kencang menyusuri lorong menuju deretan ruang kelas di lantai dua."

# game/week10.rpy:59
translate indonesian week10_romance_f01a8fe2:

    # n "Peeking through one of the windows, Trida spotted two familiar classmates sitting together with controllers in hand, absorbed in a video game on a shared laptop."
    n  "Mengintip dari balik salah satu jendela kelas, Trida melihat dua teman sekelasnya tengah asyik duduk berdua dengan stik kontroler di tangan, tenggelam dalam game di laptop bersama."

# game/week10.rpy:62
translate indonesian week10_romance_79a40752:

    # trida "Hizbul! Ilham!"
    trida  "Hizbul! Ilham!"

# game/week10.rpy:67
translate indonesian week10_romance_07adcd35:

    # ilham "Jeez! I swear, I thought you were a teacher for a second!"
    ilham  "Astagfirullah! Sumpah ya, kukira tadi guru yang masuk!"

# game/week10.rpy:69
translate indonesian week10_romance_b8cab612:

    # trida "Sorry, sorry! I got a little loud."
    trida  "Maaf, maaf! Tadi suaraku rada kekencengan ya."

# game/week10.rpy:70
translate indonesian week10_romance_25d7706a:

    # ilham "Pfft, a little? I think you woke up some sleepyheads in the back row."
    ilham  "Pfft, rada katamu? Kayaknya anak-anak yang lagi tidur di barisan belakang pada melek semua tuh."

# game/week10.rpy:72
translate indonesian week10_romance_43d73b75:

    # hizbul "Well, we just started the match. Wanna join, Trida?"
    hizbul  "Tumben banget nih. Kita baru aja mulai mabar. Mau ikutan, Trida?"

# game/week10.rpy:73
translate indonesian week10_romance_52c37130:

    # trida "Er, that'd be fun, but—"
    trida  "Uhm, seru sih kelihatannya, tapi—"

# game/week10.rpy:74
translate indonesian week10_romance_b1ef635d:

    # ilham "Come on, we haven't played a round with you in a while, Triguy! We have time to kill."
    ilham  "Ayo lah, udah lama kita nggak main bareng kamu, Triguy! Masih banyak waktu luang nih."

# game/week10.rpy:75
translate indonesian week10_romance_0df86362:

    # trida "O-Okay, I get it! I'll play the next round, but that's not what I'm here for! It's…"
    trida  "I—iya, paham! Nanti match berikutnya aku ikut, tapi tujuanku ke sini bukan buat mabar! Ada hal lain..."

# game/week10.rpy:77
translate indonesian week10_romance_0ff1ef22:

    # trida "I actually wanna… ask you guys about something, if that's alright."
    trida  "Sebenarnya aku mau... minta pendapat kalian berdua soal sesuatu, kalau kalian nggak keberatan."

# game/week10.rpy:78
translate indonesian week10_romance_5e73d93b:

    # ilham "Oh, right. What's on your mind?"
    ilham  "Oh, gitu. Mau nanya soal apa emangnya?"

# game/week10.rpy:79
translate indonesian week10_romance_7087ed0e:

    # trida "Uhm… it's not that big of a deal, really. I just need—just a small piece of advice!"
    trida  "Uhm... bukan masalah gede sih sebenarnya. Cuma butuh—butuh sedikit saran aja!"

# game/week10.rpy:80
translate indonesian week10_romance_c5e64eb4:

    # hizbul "Alright… Yeah, we'll try to help. What is it?"
    hizbul  "Oke deh... iya, kita coba bantu sebisa kita. Ada apa?"

# game/week10.rpy:82
translate indonesian week10_romance_8bc2745f:

    # trida "Okay, yeah, but—you two need to promise me that you won't tell anyone at ALL, got it?!"
    trida  "Iya, tapi—kalian berdua harus janji dulu ya jangan sampai ngebocorin ini ke siapa pun, paham?!"

# game/week10.rpy:83
translate indonesian week10_romance_5cea1799:

    # hizbul "So it's 'not a big deal' but it's a huge secret we have to keep?"
    hizbul  "Katanya tadi 'bukan masalah gede', tapi kok mendadak jadi rahasia negara yang harus dijaga ketat?"

# game/week10.rpy:84
translate indonesian week10_romance_97d762be:

    # ilham "Also pretty hard to keep a secret when you're louder than the whole room."
    ilham  "Lagian susah juga mau jaga rahasia kalau volume suaramu aja lebih kenceng dari seisi ruangan kelas."

# game/week10.rpy:85
translate indonesian week10_romance_f559e42a:

    # trida "Agh, it's just… I-I don't know how to say this…"
    trida  "Aduh, masalahnya tuh... a—aku nggak tahu harus ngomongnya gimana..."

# game/week10.rpy:86
translate indonesian week10_romance_43b67af1:

    # hizbul "Take your time, Trida. Collect your thoughts a little."
    hizbul  "Tarik napas dulu, Trida. Tenangin pikiranmu pelan-pelan."

# game/week10.rpy:88
translate indonesian week10_romance_1cd39dd8:

    # n "Trida's hands gravitated toward their pockets, fidgeting nervously with the fabric while staring down at the floor."
    n  "Tangan Trida merogoh ke dalam saku, meremas-remas kain dengan gugup sembari menatap lantai."

# game/week10.rpy:89
translate indonesian week10_romance_100d830f:

    # trida "…You guys know [player_name], right?"
    trida  "...Kalian berdua tahu [player_name] kan?"

# game/week10.rpy:90
translate indonesian week10_romance_782b8a1e:

    # hizbul "Yeah, you're usually around [player_name]. What about them?"
    hizbul  "Ya tahulah, kamu kan nempel mulu sama [player_name]. Emangnya kenapa sama dia?"

# game/week10.rpy:91
translate indonesian week10_romance_d4e2257c:

    # trida "Uhm… this might be a surprise, but…"
    trida  "Uhm... mungkin ini kedengarannya bakal bikin kaget, tapi..."

# game/week10.rpy:92
translate indonesian week10_romance_1ace6b83:

    # ilham "Gosh, just tell us already."
    ilham  "Ya ampun, buruan to the point aja napa."

# game/week10.rpy:93
translate indonesian week10_romance_5e151c1a:

    # hizbul "Ilham…!"
    hizbul  "Ilham, sabar sedikit...!"

# game/week10.rpy:95
translate indonesian week10_romance_7f3ee715:

    # trida "I…"
    trida  "Aku..."

# game/week10.rpy:96
translate indonesian week10_romance_8470294a:

    # trida "…I have a huge crush on [player_name]!"
    trida  "...aku suka banget sama [player_name]!"

# game/week10.rpy:97
translate indonesian week10_romance_2c7fa494:

    # trida "T-There, I said it!"
    trida  "N—nah, akhirnya kuomongin juga!"

# game/week10.rpy:99
translate indonesian week10_romance_7becbcce:

    # n "Hizbul and Ilham exchanged an amused look, completely unsurprised."
    n  "Hizbul dan Ilham saling bertukar pandang geli, sama sekali tidak terkejut."

# game/week10.rpy:100
translate indonesian week10_romance_2cb11811:

    # ilham "Oh right, act surprised—"
    ilham  "Oh iya, kudu pura-pura kaget nih—"

# game/week10.rpy:102
translate indonesian week10_romance_e37ef418:

    # ilham "Woah, really? I would have never guessed!"
    ilham  "Wah, masa sih? Sumpah nggak bakal ada yang nyangka!"

# game/week10.rpy:104
translate indonesian week10_romance_6344ccda:

    # hizbul "Ye-yeah, that's really… really shocking!"
    hizbul  "I—iya, beneran... mengejutkan banget lho!"

# game/week10.rpy:106
translate indonesian week10_romance_17ecfd8d:

    # trida "Now you're just messing with me…!"
    trida  "Ih, kalian malah ngeledek aku kan...!"

# game/week10.rpy:107
translate indonesian week10_romance_5aa78abb:

    # trida "C-Come on, there's no way it was THAT obvious, was it?"
    trida  "A—ayolah, masa kelihatan sejelas ITU sih gelagatku?"

# game/week10.rpy:108
translate indonesian week10_romance_ef3a9439:

    # ilham "Yeah, buddy, real subtle."
    ilham  "Iya lah, Bro, jelas banget nggak ada obat."

# game/week10.rpy:109
translate indonesian week10_romance_806bb4dc:

    # hizbul "I mean, there were definitely signs."
    hizbul  "Maksudku, sinyal-sinyalnya udah kebaca dari kapan tahu."

# game/week10.rpy:110
translate indonesian week10_romance_72697b17:

    # trida "It can't just be because I'm around them all the time! You two stick together constantly and nobody bats an eye!"
    trida  "Kan bukan berarti gara-gara aku sering bareng dia doang! Kalian berdua juga nempel terus tiap hari tapi nggak ada yang heboh tuh!"

# game/week10.rpy:111
translate indonesian week10_romance_53767c89:

    # ilham "Well, unlike you and [player_name], me and Hizbul aren't spending every waking breath together, are we?"
    ilham  "Ya bedalah, nggak kayak kamu sama [player_name], aku sama Hizbul kan nggak ngabisin tiap tarikan napas berduaan terus, ya nggak?"

# game/week10.rpy:112
translate indonesian week10_romance_cfaf6c6b:

    # hizbul "Hah, you'd get tired of me so quickly."
    hizbul  "Hahaha, lagian kamu pasti langsung bosen setengah mati sama aku."

# game/week10.rpy:113
translate indonesian week10_romance_0a31044a:

    # ilham "God forbid, I don't even want to imagine it."
    ilham  "Amit-amit deh, ngebayanginnya aja aku ogah."

# game/week10.rpy:115
translate indonesian week10_romance_1eccb39b:

    # trida "Uh—I-I guess I do follow [player_name] around pretty often… even walking home together…"
    trida  "Uh—i—iya sih, kuakui aku emang sering banget ngikutin [player_name] ke mana-mana... sampai sering jalan pulang bareng juga..."

# game/week10.rpy:116
translate indonesian week10_romance_dbf1bfd3:

    # hizbul "You also look way more relaxed around them. I don't know if you've noticed, but you tense up really easily, even around us."
    hizbul  "Lagian kamu kelihatan jauh lebih rileks pas lagi bareng dia. Nggak tahu kamu nyadar apa nggak ya, tapi kamu tuh gampang banget cemas dan tegang, bahkan pas lagi bareng kita."

# game/week10.rpy:117
translate indonesian week10_romance_1985c23c:

    # hizbul "Around them, you're more… yourself. You smile more, without worrying about keeping up appearances."
    hizbul  "Tapi pas lagi bareng dia, kamu kelihatan lebih... jadi dirimu sendiri. Kamu senyum lebih lepas, tanpa kelihatan beban harus jaga image."

# game/week10.rpy:118
translate indonesian week10_romance_13df9e34:

    # ilham "You do look completely different around [player_name] compared to anyone else."
    ilham  "Beda banget pokoknya pembawaanmu pas lagi bareng [player_name] dibanding pas bareng orang lain."

# game/week10.rpy:120
translate indonesian week10_romance_422d789b:

    # trida "I see now…"
    trida  "Begitu ya rupanya..."

# game/week10.rpy:121
translate indonesian week10_romance_f70cac8b:

    # trida "Yeah… I-I think that's one of the things I love about [player_name] the most."
    trida  "Iya... kurasa itu salah satu hal yang paling bikin aku jatuh hati sama [player_name]."

# game/week10.rpy:122
translate indonesian week10_romance_d6ff74a1:

    # trida "Like—I can always open up to [player_name] and speak my mind. They always seem to know what to say. It makes me feel calm."
    trida  "Rasanya tuh—aku selalu bisa terbuka apa adanya dan ngomongin apa pun ke [player_name]. Dia selalu tahu kata-kata yang pas buat nenangin hatiku. Bikin aku ngerasa aman dan damai."

# game/week10.rpy:123
translate indonesian week10_romance_9790f35e:

    # trida "[player_name] is just… the sweetest person I've met. Whenever they laugh or smile at a joke I make, I just want to make them even happier!"
    trida  "[player_name] itu sosok yang paling manis dan baik yang pernah kutemui. Tiap kali dia ketawa atau tersenyum denger lelucon konyolku, bawaannya pengin bikin dia jauh lebih bahagia lagi!"

# game/week10.rpy:125
translate indonesian week10_romance_3e003488:

    # trida "And—whenever they get close, my mind just goes completely blank, and I end up acting totally lame in front of them!"
    trida  "Dan—tiap kali dia duduk dekat banget di sampingku, kepalaku rasanya mendadak nge-blank total, dan ujung-ujungnya tingkahku malah jadi kaku dan memalukan di depan dia!"

# game/week10.rpy:126
translate indonesian week10_romance_77838b5f:

    # hizbul "Yeah, I get it, Trida…"
    hizbul  "Iya deh, paham banget, Trida..."

# game/week10.rpy:127
translate indonesian week10_romance_edfbeb31:

    # ilham "I didn't think someone could look like they're both deeply in love and actively having a panic attack at the exact same time."
    ilham  "Baru kali ini aku ngelihat ada orang yang mukanya kelihatan kasmaran berat tapi sekaligus kayak lagi kena serangan panik di saat yang bersamaan."

# game/week10.rpy:128
translate indonesian week10_romance_8bd88264:

    # hizbul "Ilham…"
    hizbul  "Ilham, jangan gitu napa..."

# game/week10.rpy:129
translate indonesian week10_romance_228246db:

    # trida "Ah! I was yapping again, sorry…"
    trida  "Aduh! Aku malah keterusan ngoceh lagi, maaf ya..."

# game/week10.rpy:131
translate indonesian week10_romance_3ce2dd8a:

    # trida "But like I said, I need some advice. I kinda thought, 'screw it, no better time than now.' I'm gonna confess to [player_name] in a few hours."
    trida  "Tapi kayak yang kubilang tadi, aku butuh saran kalian. Aku mikir, 'bodo amat lah, mumpung ada momen pas.' Aku mau nembak [player_name] beberapa jam lagi."

# game/week10.rpy:132
translate indonesian week10_romance_6435b7bb:

    # hizbul "Wait, what? That soon?"
    hizbul  "Tunggu, seriusan?! Secepet itu?"

# game/week10.rpy:133
translate indonesian week10_romance_f087fe5f:

    # trida "Yeah! They finish their work in about three hours. And you guys are in the public speaking club, right? I figured you'd know a thing or two about words!"
    trida  "Iya! Dia beres presentasi sekitar tiga jam lagi. Nah, kalian berdua kan anak ekskul public speaking, kan? Pasti jago merangkai kata-kata yang bagus!"

# game/week10.rpy:134
translate indonesian week10_romance_01dc9e37:

    # ilham "Why ask us? Don't look at me, Hizbul's the only one with actual dating experience."
    ilham  "Ngapain nanya ke kita berdua? Jangan lihat aku ya, cuma Hizbul yang beneran punya pengalaman pacaran di sini."

# game/week10.rpy:136
translate indonesian week10_romance_9c5e8355:

    # trida "Oh wow! You do? Tell me everything, Hizbul!"
    trida  "Wah gila! Beneran, Kak Hizbul? Kasih tahu semua rahasianya dong!"

# game/week10.rpy:137
translate indonesian week10_romance_ab38e23f:

    # hizbul "Okay, don't get too excited, I've only had one partner. But look, just be genuine. Explain how you feel clearly."
    hizbul  "Oke oke, santai dulu, jangan kelewat heboh, aku juga baru sekali pacaran. Tapi intinya, yang penting kamu jujur dari hati. Ungkapin perasaanmu dengan jelas dan tulus."

# game/week10.rpy:138
translate indonesian week10_romance_c2d1c109:

    # hizbul "Maybe invite them somewhere nice first so you can ease into it."
    hizbul  "Mungkin ajak dia ke tempat yang nyaman dulu biar suasananya nggak canggung pas kamu mulai ngomong."

# game/week10.rpy:139
translate indonesian week10_romance_293f76dc:

    # ilham "The rooftop above the cafe has a killer view of the sunset, especially around this hour."
    ilham  "Area rooftop di atas kafe sekolah punya pemandangan sunset yang gila kerennya, apalagi pas jam-jam sore begini."

# game/week10.rpy:141
translate indonesian week10_romance_304ac2e6:

    # trida "Wait, there's a rooftop you can get to?!"
    trida  "Tunggu, emang ada akses ke rooftop di sana?!"

# game/week10.rpy:142
translate indonesian week10_romance_7a40178f:

    # ilham "Yeah, take the back stairs up to the top floor of the cafe building. It overlooks the whole campus."
    ilham  "Ada, lewat tangga belakang naik ke lantai paling atas gedung kafe. Dari situ kamu bisa lihat pemandangan seluruh penjuru sekolah."

# game/week10.rpy:144
translate indonesian week10_romance_91d83614:

    # n "Ilham tore a piece of paper from his notebook and scribbled a quick map."
    n  "Ilham merobek secarik kertas dari buku catatannya lalu mencoretkan peta rute sederhana."

# game/week10.rpy:145
translate indonesian week10_romance_b82e523d:

    # ilham "Here, follow this. And write down a few bullet points of what you want to say so you don't freeze up."
    ilham  "Nih, ikutin denah ini. Terus catat beberapa poin penting yang mau kamu omongin biar nanti lidahmu nggak kelu pas di depan orangnya."

# game/week10.rpy:148
translate indonesian week10_romance_a4c790cb:

    # trida "Thank you guys so much! You're lifesavers!"
    trida  "Makasih banyak ya kalian berdua! Kalian penyelamat hidupku banget!"

# game/week10.rpy:149
translate indonesian week10_romance_f81321e4:

    # hizbul "Good luck, Trida! Hope it goes smoothly!"
    hizbul  "Semangat, Trida! Semoga semuanya lancar jaya ya!"

# game/week10.rpy:150
translate indonesian week10_romance_64f5bb88:

    # ilham "Let us know how it goes down, yeah?"
    ilham  "Nanti kabari kita gimana hasilnya, oke?"

# game/week10.rpy:161
translate indonesian week10_romance_5aaff485:

    # n "Back in the 3D Computer Lab, you finally leaned back into your office chair with a long, bone-deep stretch."
    n  "Kembali ke Lab Komputer 3D, kamu akhirnya merebahkan punggungmu di kursi kerja dengan tarikan napas lega yang meresap hingga ke tulang."

# game/week10.rpy:162
translate indonesian week10_romance_93ee0482:

    # n "After hours of relentless tweaking, the final render was exported and safely uploaded to the cloud folder."
    n  "Setelah berjam-jam berkutat melakukan revisi tanpa henti, hasil render final akhirnya berhasil diekspor dan tersimpan aman di folder penyimpanan awan."

# game/week10.rpy:163
translate indonesian week10_romance_97cd77d3:

    # n "Your throat felt bone-dry from the air-conditioned lab, and fatigue weighed heavily on your shoulders as you packed your bag and headed toward the exit."
    n  "Tenggorokanmu terasa kering kerontang akibat dinginnya hembusan AC ruangan lab, dan rasa pegal terasa berat membebani pundakmu saat kamu mengemasi tas dan melangkah menuju pintu keluar."

# game/week10.rpy:169
translate indonesian week10_romance_952a4f28:

    # n "As soon as you pushed through the building doors, you spotted Trida jogging toward you, holding an iced tea in one hand and a chocolate chip cookie in the other."
    n  "Tepat saat kamu melangkah keluar dari pintu gedung, kamu melihat Trida berlari-lari kecil menghampirimu, membawa segelas es teh di satu tangan dan sekeping kukis cokelat di tangan lainnya."

# game/week10.rpy:171
translate indonesian week10_romance_c820bf1d:

    # trida "[player_name]…!!!"
    trida  "[player_name]...!!!"

# game/week10.rpy:172
translate indonesian week10_romance_04d2de72:

    # p "Hey… you're still here?"
    p  "Hei... kamu beneran masih nungguin di sini?"

# game/week10.rpy:173
translate indonesian week10_romance_334d1593:

    # trida "Of course! I told you I'd wait!"
    trida  "Ya iya lah! Kan tadi udah janji bakal nungguin sampai selesai!"

# game/week10.rpy:175
translate indonesian week10_romance_3b598ab1:

    # trida "You look completely exhausted, though. Here—I brought you a drink and a cookie from the stall!"
    trida  "Tapi kelihatannya kamu capek banget deh. Nih—kubawain minuman segar sama kukis manis dari stan kantin!"

# game/week10.rpy:176
translate indonesian week10_romance_7300fe42:

    # p "Thanks… you're a lifesaver, Trida."
    p  "Makasih banyak ya... kamu penyelamat hidupku banget, Trida."

# game/week10.rpy:182
translate indonesian week10_romance_b9ea0eb5:

    # n "The two of you walked over to the spacious school cafe area and sank onto the cushioned sofa."
    n  "Kalian berdua berjalan santai menuju area kafe sekolah yang luas lalu menghempaskan diri di atas sofa empuk."

# game/week10.rpy:183
translate indonesian week10_romance_e8f34db1:

    # n "You took a long, refreshing sip of the sweet iced tea, letting the cold drink revive your exhausted senses."
    n  "Kamu menyeruput segarnya es teh manis itu dalam-dalam, membiarkan sensasi dinginnya membangkitkan kembali energimu yang sempat terkuras habis."

# game/week10.rpy:185
translate indonesian week10_romance_06a6bc8e:

    # trida "Better now?"
    trida  "Udah enakan sekarang?"

# game/week10.rpy:186
translate indonesian week10_romance_8fa888f7:

    # p "Way better. Thanks for waiting for me, really."
    p  "Jauh lebih mendingan. Makasih banyak ya udah mau nungguin, beneran."

# game/week10.rpy:188
translate indonesian week10_romance_337dc8cb:

    # trida "Uhm… if you aren't too tired… there's something really cool I want to show you in this building."
    trida  "Uhm... kalau kamu belum terlalu capek... ada tempat keren banget yang pengin kutunjukin ke kamu di gedung ini."

# game/week10.rpy:189
translate indonesian week10_romance_33fae930:

    # p "Huh? What's the occasion?"
    p  "Eh? Dalam rangka apa nih?"

# game/week10.rpy:190
translate indonesian week10_romance_d1180b28:

    # trida "Think of it as a reward for finishing your project! I promise it'll be worth the stairs."
    trida  "Anggap aja hadiah perayaan karena kamu udah berhasil nuntasin tugas beratmu! Kujamin deh rasa capek naik tangganya bakal sebanding sama pemandangannya."

# game/week10.rpy:191
translate indonesian week10_romance_8230f068:

    # p "It better be as cool as you're hyping it up to be."
    p  "Awas ya kalau tempatnya nggak sekeren yang kamu gembar-gemborkan tadi."

# game/week10.rpy:193
translate indonesian week10_romance_4755dec9:

    # trida "No doubt about it! Ready when you are!"
    trida  "Pasti keren dong, nggak usah ragu! Gas kapan pun kamu siap!"

# game/week10.rpy:199
translate indonesian week10_romance_3e54ea51:

    # n "Trida led you up the flights of stairs toward the top floor of the building, checking a small handwritten map tucked in their palm."
    n  "Trida menuntun langkahmu menaiki anak tangga demi anak tangga menuju lantai teratas gedung, sesekali melirik peta kecil tulisan tangan yang ia sembunyikan di telapak tangannya."

# game/week10.rpy:200
translate indonesian week10_romance_65c56036:

    # p "Are you sure you know where you're going?"
    p  "Kamu yakin tahu jalan ke sana?"

# game/week10.rpy:202
translate indonesian week10_romance_af326433:

    # trida "I'm your pirate captain leading you to the treasure! Trust me!"
    trida  "Aku ini kapten bajak laut yang lagi memandu kamu menuju harta karun berharga tahu! Percaya deh sama aku!"

# game/week10.rpy:203
translate indonesian week10_romance_e8f1277c:

    # p "I guess it really does feel like a treasure hunt…"
    p  "Iya deh, berasa lagi berburu harta karun beneran..."

# game/week10.rpy:209
translate indonesian week10_romance_9b76124d:

    # n "Pushing past the final doorway, you stepped out onto a wide, open rooftop."
    n  "Mendorong pintu terakhir hingga terbuka, langkah kakimu melangkah keluar menuju hamparan rooftop terbuka yang begitu luas."

# game/week10.rpy:210
translate indonesian week10_romance_88e4e54a:

    # n "The evening sky stretched endlessly before you, painted in a breathtaking gradient of amber gold, vivid rose, and soft indigo."
    n  "Cakrawala senja terbentang megah tanpa batas di depan mata, terlukis indah dalam gradasi warna keemasan mentari, semburat mawar merona, dan nila yang syahdu."

# game/week10.rpy:211
translate indonesian week10_romance_28ced9bb:

    # n "A cool, gentle breeze swept across the open space, carrying the faint murmur of the campus below."
    n  "Hembusan angin sepoi-sepoi yang sejuk menyapu lembut melintasi atap gedung, membawa sayup-sayup dengungan damai dari aktivitas kampus di bawah sana."

# game/week10.rpy:214
translate indonesian week10_romance_6531acb5:

    # trida "Ta-da!! The super secret rooftop!"
    trida  "Ta-daaa!! Ini dia rooftop super rahasia!"

# game/week10.rpy:219
translate indonesian week10_romance_b6e3aa2a:

    # p "It's really nice up here… The sky looks gorgeous, and the breeze feels amazing."
    p  "Bagus banget pemandangannya... Langitnya kelihatan cantik banget, udaranya juga sejuk menenangkan."

# game/week10.rpy:221
translate indonesian week10_romance_0a7447f6:

    # trida "I know, right? I felt like you needed to see this after spending all day inside."
    trida  "Iya kan? Tadi aku ngerasa kamu bener-bener butuh pemandangan kayak gini setelah seharian suntuk ngendon di dalam lab."

# game/week10.rpy:224
translate indonesian week10_romance_b0385bb0:

    # p "This is pretty high up. You can see the whole school from here."
    p  "Tinggi banget tempatnya ya. Dari sini seisi sekolah kelihatan semua."

# game/week10.rpy:226
translate indonesian week10_romance_23534f0d:

    # trida "Right? Feels like you're standing on top of the world!"
    trida  "Keren kan? Berasa lagi berdiri di puncak dunia!"

# game/week10.rpy:229
translate indonesian week10_romance_63e4ac23:

    # p "So is this a place we're actually allowed to be in? Not much of a secret if we get caught."
    p  "Tempat ini emang boleh dimasukin ya? Nggak lucu kalau dibilang rahasia tapi ujung-ujungnya malah keciduk guru."

# game/week10.rpy:231
translate indonesian week10_romance_9b5c534a:

    # trida "Wha—no, it's totally safe! Ilham told me about it. As long as you're careful, it's fine!"
    trida  "E—eh, aman kok beneran! Tadi Ilham yang ngasih tahu lokasinya. Asal kita hati-hati nggak bakal kenapa-kenapa!"

# game/week10.rpy:232
translate indonesian week10_romance_d4c81a4e:

    # p "…Fair enough. It really is a nice spot."
    p  "...Bagus deh kalau gitu. Tempatnya bener-bener damai dan nyaman."

# game/week10.rpy:234
translate indonesian week10_romance_d0149bf3:

    # n "You leaned against the railing, taking in the tranquil beauty of the dusk."
    n  "Kamu menyandarkan tubuhmu di pagar pembatas, meresapi keindahan hening di kala senja menjelang."

# game/week10.rpy:235
translate indonesian week10_romance_6c4611b0:

    # n "Beside you, Trida grew unusually quiet. Their fingers nervously tapped against their pockets, breath hitching as they gathered their resolve."
    n  "Di sampingmu, Trida mendadak terdiam sunyi, tak seperti biasanya. Jemarinya mengetuk-ngetuk saku celananya dengan gugup, tarikan napasnya tertahan saat ia mengumpulkan segenap keberaniannya."

# game/week10.rpy:238
translate indonesian week10_romance_b9309550:

    # trida "Uhm… [player_name]?"
    trida  "Uhm... [player_name]?"

# game/week10.rpy:239
translate indonesian week10_romance_38a51515:

    # p "Yeah? Everything okay?"
    p  "Iya? Ada apa, Trida?"

# game/week10.rpy:241
translate indonesian week10_romance_63038db2:

    # trida "I've… I've actually been meaning to tell you something really, really important."
    trida  "Sebenarnya... ada sesuatu yang amat sangat penting yang udah lama banget pengin kuomongin ke kamu."

# game/week10.rpy:242
translate indonesian week10_romance_d3529451:

    # trida "That's why I wanted us to come up here."
    trida  "Itu alasan kenapa aku ngajak kamu naik ke sini sore ini."

# game/week10.rpy:243
translate indonesian week10_romance_9080b122:

    # p "What is it, Trida? You don't have to beat around the bush."
    p  "Mau ngomong apa emangnya, Trida? Ngomong aja, nggak usah sungkan."

# game/week10.rpy:246
translate indonesian week10_romance_5f79f492:

    # trida "Listen… I know we've only known each other for a few months."
    trida  "Dengerin ya... Aku tahu kita baru kenal beberapa bulan di sekolah ini."

# game/week10.rpy:247
translate indonesian week10_romance_d779dad4:

    # trida "But it feels like it's been forever. Like… we were destined to meet, or something like that."
    trida  "Tapi rasanya udah kayak kenal lama banget. Kayak... kita emang ditakdirkan buat ketemu satu sama lain, atau hal semacam itu."

# game/week10.rpy:248
translate indonesian week10_romance_c5720b54:

    # trida "You've always been there for me. Even when I'm being an anxious mess, you always know what to say. You make me feel safe."
    trida  "Kamu selalu ada buat aku. Bahkan pas aku lagi panik dan kacau nggak keruan, kamu selalu tahu apa yang harus diucapin. Kamu bikin aku ngerasa aman."

# game/week10.rpy:249
translate indonesian week10_romance_40945e77:

    # trida "And lately… I've started noticing all these little things."
    trida  "Dan belakangan ini... aku mulai menyadari banyak hal kecil di antara kita."

# game/week10.rpy:250
translate indonesian week10_romance_6cb77c85:

    # trida "How much I laugh when I'm around you… how my heart starts racing every time you're close… how much I wish our walks together would never end."
    trida  "Betapa lepasnya tawaku tiap kali bareng kamu... betapa berdegup kencangnya jantungku tiap kali kamu ada di dekatku... betapa aku berharap langkah jalan kita berdua nggak pernah berakhir."

# game/week10.rpy:252
translate indonesian week10_romance_e6225e9c:

    # n "Trida took a deep, trembling breath, their cheeks flushing crimson under the warm sunset glow."
    n  "Trida menarik napas panjang yang bergetar, kedua pipinya merona merah padam di bawah pendar hangatnya semburat lembayung senja."

# game/week10.rpy:254
translate indonesian week10_romance_ed8823a0:

    # trida "The point is… I really, really like you!!"
    trida  "Intinya... aku bener-bener tulus suka banget sama kamu!!"

# game/week10.rpy:255
translate indonesian week10_romance_d4ce73af:

    # trida "I have a huge crush on you, [player_name]!"
    trida  "Aku jatuh cinta sama kamu, [player_name]!"

# game/week10.rpy:256
translate indonesian week10_romance_1070fdef:

    # trida "I'm sorry for keeping it inside for so long… I was just so scared of ruining what we have."
    trida  "Maaf ya aku simpan perasaan ini sendirian kelamaan... Aku cuma takut banget bakal ngerusak kedekatan yang udah kita punya selama ini."

# game/week10.rpy:257
translate indonesian week10_romance_33a15a9a:

    # trida "Do you… do you feel anything like that for me too?"
    trida  "Kamu... apa kamu punya perasaan yang sama kayak yang kurasain ini?"

# game/week10.rpy:274
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_9b4d28a7:

    # p "I never thought you'd say it first… but to be honest, Trida… I love you too."
    p  "Nggak nyangka kamu bakal ngomong duluan... tapi sejujurnya, Trida... aku juga sayang banget sama kamu."

# game/week10.rpy:276
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_0b6d13f5:

    # trida "Wait—really…?"
    trida  "Tunggu—beneran nih...?"

# game/week10.rpy:277
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_4dfaf348:

    # p "Of course I do! I've had feelings for you for a while now."
    p  "Tentu aja beneran! Aku udah punya perasaan ini ke kamu dari kemarin-kemarin."

# game/week10.rpy:278
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_7550cc02:

    # p "Your smile lights up every room you walk into, and your energy is completely contagious."
    p  "Senyumanmu selalu berhasil menghangatkan ruangan mana pun yang kamu masuki, dan energimu bener-bener menular bikin bahagia."

# game/week10.rpy:279
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_2daada10:

    # p "I admire your passion, your resilience, and how much you care about everyone around you."
    p  "Aku kagum sama semangatmu, ketangguhanmu, dan betapa tulusnya kamu peduli sama orang-orang di sekitarmu."

# game/week10.rpy:280
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_5b0dc00f:

    # p "When my heart started skipping beats every time you leaned in… that's when I knew I wanted to be more than just friends."
    p  "Pas jantungku mulai berdegup nggak keruan tiap kali kamu mendekat... di saat itulah aku sadar kalau aku pengin kita lebih dari sekadar teman biasa."

# game/week10.rpy:282
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_ec0cac56:

    # n "Trida stood frozen, tears glistening in their orange eyes even as a radiant, tearful smile broke across their face."
    n  "Trida terpaku kaku di tempatnya berdiri, butiran air mata berkaca-kaca di sepasang mata oranyenya bersamaan dengan senyuman haru yang merekah begitu indah di parasnya."

# game/week10.rpy:284
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_382b88b3:

    # trida "I'm… I'm so happy. I really didn't think you'd feel the same way…"
    trida  "Aku... aku bahagia banget. Sumpah tadi sempat kepikiran kalau perasaanku bakal bertepuk sebelah tangan..."

# game/week10.rpy:285
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_99f376d5:

    # p "I do. Entirely."
    p  "Perasaanku sama seutuhnya kayak perasaanmu kok."

# game/week10.rpy:286
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_97ce408f:

    # trida "Does that mean… we're together now?"
    trida  "Berarti... sekarang kita resmi jadian ya?"

# game/week10.rpy:287
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_3a70f149:

    # p "I certainly hope so."
    p  "Jelas dong, kuharap juga begitu."

# game/week10.rpy:289
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_a59e9f6f:

    # n "Under the brilliant glow of the evening sky, you pulled Trida into a warm embrace."
    n  "Di bawah pendar megah semburat langit senja, kamu menarik tubuh Trida ke dalam dekapan hangat yang erat."

# game/week10.rpy:290
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_1b1d1dbe:

    # n "Trida buried their face against your shoulder, laughing through happy tears as their arms wrapped tightly around you."
    n  "Trida membenamkan wajahnya di bahumu, tertawa bahagia di sela-sela air mata harunya saat kedua tangannya melingkar mendekap erat tubuhmu."

# game/week10.rpy:291
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_1454955a:

    # trida "I love you, [player_name]… so much."
    trida  "Aku sayang banget sama kamu, [player_name]... sayang banget."

# game/week10.rpy:297
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_1a2495f0:

    # n "As the sun set over SMK Raden Umar Said, a brand new chapter began."
    n  "Seiring tenggelamnya sang surya di atas SMK Raden Umar Said, sebuah lembaran kisah yang baru resmi dimulai."

# game/week10.rpy:298
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_84bf5ffc:

    # n "Not just as classmates, but as two hearts moving forward together."
    n  "Bukan lagi sekadar teman sekelas, melainkan dua hati yang kini melangkah maju beriringan."

# game/week10.rpy:299
translate indonesian week10_romance_good_e3289c79:

    # n "{b}— ROMANCE ROUTE: TRUE ENDING —{/b}"
    n  "{b}— RUTE ROMANSA: TRUE ENDING —{/b}"

# game/week10.rpy:311
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_c6b0ba83:

    # p "Trida… thank you for telling me. It means a lot that you trust me that much."
    p  "Trida... makasih banyak ya udah jujur mengutarakan perasaanmu. Aku sangat menghargai betapa besarnya rasa percayamu ke aku."

# game/week10.rpy:312
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_b0889e44:

    # p "I really care about you, but… right now, I value our friendship more than anything. I want us to stay best friends."
    p  "Aku bener-bener peduli sama kamu, tapi... untuk saat ini, aku lebih menghargai ikatan persahabatan kita lebih dari apa pun. Aku ingin kita tetap jadi sahabat terbaik."

# game/week10.rpy:314
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_f2b53343:

    # trida "Ah… don't worry, I completely get it!"
    trida  "Ah... santai aja, aku ngerti dan paham banget kok!"

# game/week10.rpy:315
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_fa5bf732:

    # trida "I just really needed to get it off my chest. But we're staying friends, right?"
    trida  "Aku emang cuma butuh ngeluarin beban rasa ini dari dadaku aja. Tapi kita bakal tetep temenan kan?"

# game/week10.rpy:316
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_9f4f462a:

    # p "Always. You're my best friend, Trida."
    p  "Pasti. Kamu sahabat terbaikku, Trida."

# game/week10.rpy:318
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_12d10433:

    # trida "That just means we'll stay the best dynamic duo in the school! Deal!"
    trida  "Berarti kita bakal tetep jadi duo terhebat dan paling kompak di sekolah ini! Sepakat!"

# game/week10.rpy:324
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_aaf967fc:

    # n "Even without romance, the bond you built with Trida remained unshakable."
    n  "Meski tanpa terikat asmara, ikatan yang telah kalian bangun bersama Trida tetap berdiri kokoh tak tergoyahkan."

# game/week10.rpy:325
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_22d24110:

    # n "A friendship forged in laughter, late-night renders, and unconditional trust."
    n  "Sebuah jalinan persahabatan sejati yang ditempa oleh tawa riang, lembur tugas malam hari, dan rasa saling percaya tanpa syarat."

# game/week10.rpy:326
translate indonesian week10_romance_friendship_7396a4d7:

    # n "{b}— FRIENDSHIP ENDING —{/b}"
    n  "{b}— FRIENDSHIP ENDING —{/b}"

# game/week10.rpy:338
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_51cfa4e8:

    # p "Why… why would you say something like that?"
    p  "Kenapa... kenapa kamu harus ngomong hal kayak gitu?"

# game/week10.rpy:340
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_392cb577:

    # trida "H-Huh?"
    trida  "E—eh?"

# game/week10.rpy:341
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_babb8cc0:

    # p "We can't just stay friends like this with feelings in the way. It's better if we keep our distance."
    p  "Kita nggak bakal bisa temenan biasa lagi kalau ada perasaan kayak gitu di tengah-tengah kita. Mending mulai sekarang kita jaga jarak aja."

# game/week10.rpy:343
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_306712ee:

    # trida "W-What do you mean? If you don't like me back, that's fine, but why stop being friends?!"
    trida  "M—maksudmu gimana? Kalau kamu nggak punya perasaan yang sama ke aku nggak apa-apa, tapi kenapa sampai harus berhenti temenan?!"

# game/week10.rpy:344
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_e59d921d:

    # p "Because it'll just hurt more down the line. I'm sorry, Trida."
    p  "Karena ke depannya hal ini cuma bakal bikin keadaan jadi makin sakit. Maaf ya, Trida."

# game/week10.rpy:346
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_60fe806f:

    # n "You turned around and walked toward the stairwell, leaving Trida alone on the windy rooftop."
    n  "Kamu berbalik badan dan melangkah menuju pintu tangga, meninggalkan Trida seorang diri di atas rooftop yang berangin dingin."

# game/week10.rpy:347
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_67f11312:

    # n "Behind you, the quiet, broken sobs of your once-brightest friend echoed against the twilight chill."
    n  "Di belakangmu, isak tangis pilu yang pecah dari sosok sahabatmu yang paling ceria perlahan bergema menyayat dinginnya hembusan angin senja."

# game/week10.rpy:353
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_db015add:

    # n "Some words, once spoken, can never be taken back."
    n  "Beberapa kata yang telah terucap, sekali terlontar, tak akan pernah bisa ditarik kembali."

# game/week10.rpy:354
translate indonesian week10_romance_bad_483d3d2b:

    # n "{b}— BAD ENDING —{/b}"
    n  "{b}— BAD ENDING —{/b}"

# game/week10.rpy:369
translate indonesian week10_friendship_029e569d:

    # n "Under the blazing saffron sunset, you and Trida took slow, leisurely strides side by side toward the boarding house."
    n  "Di bawah siraman semburat lembayung senja yang keemasan, kamu dan Trida melangkahkan kaki santai beriringan menyusuri jalan pulang menuju kosan."

# game/week10.rpy:370
translate indonesian week10_friendship_3a0eca40:

    # n "Plastic bags carrying dinner boxes gently swayed with your steps, accompanied by the distant rumble of evening traffic."
    n  "Kantong plastik berisi kotak makanan malam berayun lembut mengikuti irama langkah kaki kalian, ditemani sayup-sayup deru kendaraan petang di kejauhan."

# game/week10.rpy:373
translate indonesian week10_friendship_d68e33ee:

    # trida "Hngh… Ahh, long day, eh? Man, I haven't even finished all of my assignments!"
    trida  "Huuwah... Akhirnya ya, hari yang panjang banget! Asli deh, tugas-tugasku buat minggu ini aja masih banyak yang belum beres!"

# game/week10.rpy:374
translate indonesian week10_friendship_3717aed2:

    # p "At least we got the hardest parts done. Better than nothing—we can relax a bit tonight."
    p  "Seenggaknya bagian paling susahnya udah kelar kita beresin. Mendingan daripada nggak sama sekali—malam ini kita bisa sedikit santai."

# game/week10.rpy:376
translate indonesian week10_friendship_f6831908:

    # trida "For sure! Though I think I still have some energy left. I might just finish the whole week's work tonight!"
    trida  "Bener banget! Tapi kayaknya tenagaku masih ada sisa nih. Siapa tahu malam ini aku bisa kebut nyelesein semua sisa tugas seminggu penuh!"

# game/week10.rpy:377
translate indonesian week10_friendship_3ee794cc:

    # p "I seriously wish I had your stamina sometimes…"
    p  "Kadang aku bener-bener iri sama energimu yang kayak nggak ada habisnya itu..."

# game/week10.rpy:378
translate indonesian week10_friendship_c0805778:

    # trida "Hey, that's why I ask to walk everywhere with you! It's good to get some movement in! Helps with endurance."
    trida  "Makanya tiap mau ke mana-mana aku selalu ngajak kamu jalan kaki bareng! Biar badan ada geraknya! Nambah stamina tahu."

# game/week10.rpy:379
translate indonesian week10_friendship_c3d1fa5f:

    # p "Helps when you're enduring slow-paced games like Goblin/Goobers, I'm sure."
    p  "Berguna banget ya buat nahan sabar pas main game dengan pacing lambat kayak Goblin/Goobers, iya kan?"

# game/week10.rpy:381
translate indonesian week10_friendship_7f78ae5c:

    # trida "Alright, don't talk bad about GG like that! You haven't even played it!"
    trida  "Hush, jangan asal ngejek game GG gitu napa! Kamu kan belum pernah nyoba mainin!"

# game/week10.rpy:382
translate indonesian week10_friendship_7e4b0b6f:

    # p "Didn't you tell me the story was slow even for you?"
    p  "Bukannya kamu sendiri yang kemarin bilang kalau alur ceritanya kelewat lambat bahkan buat standarmu?"

# game/week10.rpy:383
translate indonesian week10_friendship_58bf6133:

    # trida "Well, you don't need endurance when the plot gets this good! Especially if you pick the Goobers' storyline!"
    trida  "Ya kan nggak butuh banyak sabar kalau ceritanya udah mulai seru banget! Apalagi kalau kamu milih rute cerita faksi Goobers!"

# game/week10.rpy:385
translate indonesian week10_friendship_0df69c54:

    # n "Trida launched into an impassioned, animated explanation of the game's lore."
    n  "Trida mulai menjelaskan dengan penuh semangat dan gestur tubuh yang heboh mengenai lore mendalam dari game tersebut."

# game/week10.rpy:386
translate indonesian week10_friendship_d4a9133f:

    # n "Their words flowed with genuine enthusiasm, bringing color to the quiet sidewalk as the sunset bathed their features in honey-magenta light."
    n  "Kata-katanya mengalir deras sarat dengan antusiasme yang tulus, memberi warna ceria di sepanjang trotoar saat sinar senja mewarnai wajahnya dengan semburat jingga kemerahan."

# game/week10.rpy:388
translate indonesian week10_friendship_776bcfdf:

    # trida "Ooh, I'm curious about something!"
    trida  "Ooh, aku jadi penasaran nih!"

# game/week10.rpy:390
translate indonesian week10_friendship_b0d87fb3:

    # trida "[player_name], just from what I told you, which storyline would you have picked?"
    trida  "[player_name], dari cerita yang kubahas tadi, kira-kira kamu bakal milih alur cerita yang mana?"

# game/week10.rpy:395
translate indonesian week10_friendship_4ce0a746:

    # p "The Goobers. The story sounds interesting, and I wouldn't mind a slower pace for an immersive narrative."
    p  "Faksi Goobers. Alur ceritanya kedengaran menarik, dan aku nggak keberatan sama alur yang lambat asalkan narasi dunianya mendalam."

# game/week10.rpy:397
translate indonesian week10_friendship_459eed2f:

    # trida "I see! I'm on the same boat as you! The harder the grind, the better it feels when you reach a big plot point!"
    trida  "Tuh kan bener! Kita sepemikiran banget! Makin keras perjuangan grinding-nya, makin nikmat kepuasannya pas nyampe ke titik plot cerita yang gede!"

# game/week10.rpy:400
translate indonesian week10_friendship_18ed2e75:

    # p "The Goblins. Good gameplay and mechanics are what make a game truly enjoyable to play."
    p  "Faksi Goblins. Gameplay yang solid sama mekanik game yang asyik itu kunci utama yang bikin sebuah game bener-bener seru buat dimainin."

# game/week10.rpy:402
translate indonesian week10_friendship_01be827b:

    # trida "I had a feeling you'd say that! You seem like a gameplay-first type of player!"
    trida  "Udah ketebak sih kamu bakal jawab begitu! Kamu emang tipe pemain yang lebih mentingin gameplay dulu!"

# game/week10.rpy:405
translate indonesian week10_friendship_5a2e7ad1:

    # p "I'd play both, honestly."
    p  "Dua-duanya bakal kumainin sih, jujur aja."

# game/week10.rpy:407
translate indonesian week10_friendship_6147d8b3:

    # trida "Hm… completionist, huh? Or are you just saying that because you weren't fully listening?"
    trida  "Hm... tipe pemain completionist ya? Atau kamu jawab begitu cuma gara-gara dari tadi nggak bener-bener nyimak omonganku nih?"

# game/week10.rpy:408
translate indonesian week10_friendship_ceca2913:

    # p "Well…"
    p  "Yah... gimana ya..."

# game/week10.rpy:410
translate indonesian week10_friendship_13a7846c:

    # trida "Busted! Haha, it's alright!"
    trida  "Ketahuan kan! Hahaha, tapi nggak apa-apa kok!"

# game/week10.rpy:412
translate indonesian week10_friendship_023e9ba8:

    # n "Trida fell into a comfortable, quiet rhythm beside you, looking up at the scattered clouds as the dusk deepened."
    n  "Trida kembali menyelaraskan langkahnya dalam ritme hening yang nyaman di sampingmu, menengadah memandangi gumpalan awan senja yang kian temaram."

# game/week10.rpy:413
translate indonesian week10_friendship_1686ff2f:

    # p "You know, Trida… it really doesn't feel like it's been three months since we started school, does it?"
    p  "Nggak berasa ya, Trida... rasanya belum lama banget kita baru masuk sekolah tiga bulan yang lalu, iya kan?"

# game/week10.rpy:415
translate indonesian week10_friendship_c8644ac7:

    # trida "Woah, now that you say that… July, August, September… It's already September!"
    trida  "Wah, iya juga ya pas kamu sebut gitu... Juli, Agustus, September... sekarang udah bulan September aja!"

# game/week10.rpy:416
translate indonesian week10_friendship_ae1e83db:

    # trida "It went by so fast, but it also feels like we've known each other forever."
    trida  "Waktunya cepet banget lewat, tapi di sisi lain rasanya kayak kita udah saling kenal dari dulu."

# game/week10.rpy:417
translate indonesian week10_friendship_66140c27:

    # p "It's been really comfortable having you around."
    p  "Rasanya nyaman banget punya teman kayak kamu di sampingku."

# game/week10.rpy:419
translate indonesian week10_friendship_855446bc:

    # trida "Exactly! I've never felt so at home at school before. I'm really glad we became friends, [player_name]."
    trida  "Bener banget! Aku belum pernah ngerasa senyaman ini di lingkungan sekolah sebelumnya. Aku bener-bener bersyukur banget kita bisa jadi teman akrab, [player_name]."

# game/week10.rpy:425
translate indonesian week10_friendship_dac867d8:

    # n "Arriving at the boarding house, the two of you settled into the quiet lounge chairs with your warm dinner boxes."
    n  "Setibanya di kosan, kalian berdua mendudukkan diri di kursi santai yang nyaman dengan kotak makan malam hangat di hadapan kalian."

# game/week10.rpy:426
translate indonesian week10_friendship_41688333:

    # n "The savory scent of barbecue fried chicken and chicken katsu rice filled the cozy room."
    n  "Aroma sedap ayam goreng barbeku dan nasi katsu ayam memenuhi kehangatan ruangan itu."

# game/week10.rpy:429
translate indonesian week10_friendship_9268f6d3:

    # trida "Come on, eat up before it gets cold! Weren't you starving earlier?"
    trida  "Ayo buruan dimakan sebelum dingin! Tadi katanya kamu udah kelaparan banget kan?"

# game/week10.rpy:430
translate indonesian week10_friendship_784efae5:

    # p "Right on it."
    p  "Siap, langsung sikat nih."

# game/week10.rpy:432
translate indonesian week10_friendship_efb29d6f:

    # n "Trida took a huge bite of their rice bowl, immediately choking on the sudden mouthful."
    n  "Trida menyendok nasi dalam porsi besar ke mulutnya, dan seketika tersedak suapan yang terlalu terburu-buru itu."

# game/week10.rpy:434
translate indonesian week10_friendship_49e9c7a5:

    # trida "*COUGH* *COUGH* Ow—water—!"
    trida  "*UHUK* *UHUK* Aduh—air—minum—!"

# game/week10.rpy:435
translate indonesian week10_friendship_27138ff2:

    # p "Here, take mine. Slow down!"
    p  "Nih, minum punyaku dulu. Pelan-pelan makannya!"

# game/week10.rpy:436
translate indonesian week10_friendship_6ec5414f:

    # n "You handed over your water bottle, watching Trida chug it down with frantic relief."
    n  "Kamu menyodorkan botol minummu, memperhatikan Trida yang meneguknya rakus dengan rasa lega yang berantakan."

# game/week10.rpy:438
translate indonesian week10_friendship_714a051d:

    # trida "Phew… thanks. Paramedic of the year right there."
    trida  "Fuihh... makasih banyak. Bener-bener layak dinobatkan jadi tenaga medis terbaik tahun ini."

# game/week10.rpy:439
translate indonesian week10_friendship_b0edd34a:

    # p "Speaking of extracurriculars, actually, how's theatre practice treating you?"
    p  "Ngomong-ngomong soal kegiatan, latihan teatermu gimana kabarnya belakangan ini?"

# game/week10.rpy:440
translate indonesian week10_friendship_ea0a9a5e:

    # trida "Theatre? It's been a blast! They recommended me for the aloof comedic relief role."
    trida  "Teater? Seru parah! Kemarin aku direkomendasikan buat meranin karakter lucu yang agak absurd gitu."

# game/week10.rpy:441
translate indonesian week10_friendship_80b7dcac:

    # p "That sounds like a role tailored specifically for you."
    p  "Kedengarannya emang peran yang sengaja dibikin khusus buat dirimu banget."

# game/week10.rpy:442
translate indonesian week10_friendship_0a751507:

    # trida "Hey! I'll take that as a compliment!"
    trida  "Dih! Kuanggap itu sebagai pujian ya!"

# game/week10.rpy:443
translate indonesian week10_friendship_31b10540:

    # trida "What about you? Did you do any club activities today?"
    trida  "Kalau kamu gimana? Tadi sempat ada kegiatan ekskul nggak?"

# game/week10.rpy:447
translate indonesian week10_friendship_df152916:

    # p "Eh, I decided not to join any clubs for now. Don't want things getting too hectic."
    p  "Aku belum ikut ekskul apa pun dulu buat sekarang. Takutnya malah keteteran kalau terlalu padat."

# game/week10.rpy:449
translate indonesian week10_friendship_539e0f17:

    # trida "Good point! School work is already plenty on its own."
    trida  "Pilihan bijak sih! Tugas sekolah harian aja udah cukup bikin kepala mau pecah."

# game/week10.rpy:451
translate indonesian week10_friendship_03cf5fa5:

    # p "I joined filmmaking, but our meetings are on different days."
    p  "Aku ikut ekskul perfilman, tapi jadwal kumpulnya di hari yang berbeda."

# game/week10.rpy:453
translate indonesian week10_friendship_4fb17f7e:

    # trida "Woah, filmmaking! If you ever need an actor for a scene, you know who to call!"
    trida  "Wah, perfilman! Kalau sewaktu-waktu kamu butuh aktor berbakat buat adegan filmmu, kamu tahu kan harus hubungi siapa!"

# game/week10.rpy:454
translate indonesian week10_friendship_41084893:

    # p "I'll keep your audition tape on file, Trida."
    p  "Nanti rekaman audisimu kusimpan rapi di arsip ya, Trida."

# game/week10.rpy:456
translate indonesian week10_friendship_3323eab4:

    # p "I had public speaking earlier. We did debate practice."
    p  "Tadi aku ikut ekskul public speaking. Kita latihan debat tadi."

# game/week10.rpy:458
translate indonesian week10_friendship_bea8b05e:

    # trida "Debate? Like that lawyer game you always watch me play?"
    trida  "Debat? Kayak game pengacara yang sering kamu tontonin pas aku main itu ya?"

# game/week10.rpy:459
translate indonesian week10_friendship_ed4749ec:

    # p "Pretty much, yeah."
    p  "Kurang lebih mirip kayak gitu sih."

# game/week10.rpy:461
translate indonesian week10_friendship_bcd4e590:

    # n "The conversation slowed into a comfortable stillness as you finished your meals."
    n  "Obrolan santai itu perlahan mereda menjadi keheningan yang nyaman saat kalian berdua menandaskan santap malam."

# game/week10.rpy:462
translate indonesian week10_friendship_19375eb4:

    # n "Trida set their empty box on the coffee table, their playful expression softening into something sincere and grounded."
    n  "Trida meletakkan kotak makannya yang sudah kosong di atas meja kopi, raut wajahnya yang usil melembut berganti ekspresi yang begitu tulus dan bersahaja."

# game/week10.rpy:465
translate indonesian week10_friendship_1cb0ae3f:

    # trida "[player_name]… I just wanted to say thank you."
    trida  "[player_name]... aku cuma mau bilang makasih banyak ya."

# game/week10.rpy:466
translate indonesian week10_friendship_b9fd5675:

    # p "For what?"
    p  "Makasih buat apa?"

# game/week10.rpy:467
translate indonesian week10_friendship_430ff23d:

    # trida "For everything these past few weeks. When that group project fell apart and I felt like a total failure…"
    trida  "Buat semuanya selama beberapa pekan terakhir ini. Pas tugas kelompok kemarin berantakan dan aku ngerasa jadi manusia paling gagal sedunia..."

# game/week10.rpy:468
translate indonesian week10_friendship_00ff8a70:

    # trida "You didn't judge me. You didn't get tired of my panicking. You listened to me and reminded me that I'm not useless."
    trida  "Kamu nggak menghakimiku sama sekali. Kamu nggak pernah capek ngadepin kepanikanku. Kamu selalu dengerin keluh kesahku dan ngingetin kalau aku bukan orang yang nggak berguna."

# game/week10.rpy:470
translate indonesian week10_friendship_b91127df:

    # trida "I always felt like I had to be the loud, funny one so people wouldn't get bored of me. But with you, I don't have to pretend."
    trida  "Selama ini aku selalu ngerasa harus jadi orang yang berisik dan lucu biar orang lain nggak bosen temenan sama aku. Tapi pas bareng kamu, aku nggak perlu pura-pura jadi siapa pun."

# game/week10.rpy:471
translate indonesian week10_friendship_41d413c9:

    # trida "You're the best friend I could have ever asked for in this school."
    trida  "Kamu sahabat terbaik yang pernah kumiliki di sekolah ini."

# game/week10.rpy:472
translate indonesian week10_friendship_a6447632:

    # p "There's no need to thank me, Trida. You bring so much to the table yourself."
    p  "Nggak perlu berterima kasih segitunya kok, Trida. Kamu sendiri punya banyak hal luar biasa yang berharga."

# game/week10.rpy:473
translate indonesian week10_friendship_ebfed8fb:

    # p "Your…"
    p  "Hal yang paling kukagumi darimu itu..."

# game/week10.rpy:478
translate indonesian week10_friendship_4001c704:

    # p "Your positivity. You make every room you walk into brighter just by being yourself."
    p  "Sifat positifmu. Kamu selalu bikin ruangan mana pun jadi terasa jauh lebih hangat dan ceria cuma dengan jadi dirimu sendiri."

# game/week10.rpy:480
translate indonesian week10_friendship_c85d46f8:

    # trida "You really think so? Thank you… that means the world to me."
    trida  "Kamu beneran mikir begitu? Makasih ya... kata-katamu berarti banget buat aku."

# game/week10.rpy:483
translate indonesian week10_friendship_13665e0d:

    # p "Your resilience. No matter how tough things get, you always pick yourself back up and keep trying."
    p  "Ketangguhanmu. Seberat apa pun masalah yang datang, kamu selalu bisa bangkit lagi dan terus mencoba tanpa menyerah."

# game/week10.rpy:485
translate indonesian week10_friendship_188cbcde:

    # trida "I try my best! Having someone like you cheering me on makes it way easier."
    trida  "Aku selalu berusaha yang terbaik! Punya teman kayak kamu yang selalu ngedukung bikin semuanya terasa berkali-kali lipat lebih ringan."

# game/week10.rpy:488
translate indonesian week10_friendship_ecb5e48d:

    # p "Your passion. Your boundless curiosity for 3D art, games, and storytelling is genuinely contagious."
    p  "Semangat dan passion-mu. Rasa penasaran dan antusiasmemu yang tanpa batas soal seni 3D, game, dan cerita fiksi bener-bener menular bikin orang lain ikut bersemangat."

# game/week10.rpy:490
translate indonesian week10_friendship_ec6dccf9:

    # trida "Hehe… I guess I do get a little carried away, don't I? But I'm glad you enjoy it."
    trida  "Hehehe... iya juga ya, kadang aku emang suka kelewat heboh kalau udah ngomongin hobi. Tapi aku seneng banget kalau kamu bisa ikut nikmatin ceritanya."

# game/week10.rpy:492
translate indonesian week10_friendship_7f3653c8:

    # n "Trida leaned back into the armchair, a peaceful, contented smile gracing their features."
    n  "Trida menyandarkan tubuhnya di kursi santai, seulas senyuman damai dan puas terlukis indah di wajahnya."

# game/week10.rpy:493
translate indonesian week10_friendship_4497b6a3:

    # trida "My goal… is to make games and animations that bring people the same joy and comfort that stories gave me."
    trida  "Impianku... adalah bikin game dan animasi yang bisa ngasih kebahagiaan dan kehangatan yang sama kayak yang pernah kurasain dari cerita-cerita hebat."

# game/week10.rpy:494
translate indonesian week10_friendship_28e863cd:

    # trida "And having a friend like you walking beside me… makes me feel like I can actually achieve it."
    trida  "Dan punya sahabat kayak kamu yang melangkah beriringan di sampingku... bikin aku yakin kalau impian itu beneran bisa kuraih suatu hari nanti."

# game/week10.rpy:495
translate indonesian week10_friendship_b6a6d184:

    # p "I know you will, Trida. We've got plenty of time ahead of us."
    p  "Aku yakin kamu pasti bisa, Trida. Perjalanan kita di depan masih sangat panjang."

# game/week10.rpy:501
translate indonesian week10_friendship_e994625f:

    # n "Surrounded by the comforting hum of the evening, you shared a quiet laugh with your closest companion."
    n  "Dikelilingi hangatnya keheningan malam, kamu berbagi tawa kecil nan tulus bersama sahabat terdekatmu."

# game/week10.rpy:502
translate indonesian week10_friendship_85970775:

    # n "No matter what challenges the school year would bring, you knew you would face them together."
    n  "Rintangan apa pun yang akan menghadang di tahun ajaran baru nanti, kamu tahu bahwa kalian berdua akan selalu menghadapinya bersama-sama."

# game/week10.rpy:503
translate indonesian week10_friendship_06110b9d:

    # n "{b}— FRIENDSHIP ROUTE: TRUE ENDING —{/b}"
    n  "{b}— RUTE PERSAHABATAN: TRUE ENDING —{/b}"

